      ],
      "exact_text": "The anchor trunk was failing, and the line was still looped around his harness.",
      "reason": "Cutting the line is justified, but 'anchor trunk failing' conflicts with Nisa holding the line and with the bridge falling; the causal chain of what falls is muddled."
    },
    {
