      "repair_scope": "LOCAL_REPAIR",
      "span_ids": [
        "S182",
        "S183"
      ],
      "exact_text": "The gliders still waited where the old knotted trunk leaned",
      "reason": "The line was unfastened from the trunk at the shore, and the glider's tilt was held by the line; the story never shows the gliders being secured, and Nisa's glider landing is never shown."
    },
    {
